Commonwealth authorities or officers of the Commonwealth under the <legref
refid="act-1994-053" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Agricultural and Veterinary Chemicals (New South Wales) Act
1994</i></name></legref> and other State co-operative scheme laws; and for
