<head>
<no>2</no><heading guid="_3345bc53-ab66-4d13-9095-ef7d92c452aa"
id="sec.2-he"><b>Commencement</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act commences on a day or days to be
appointed by proclamation.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_d2a126ce-66de-4a6f-8d2e-4f63410e13d1"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>3</no><heading guid="_51a7d86a-2e95-4c22-9fe9-37ab69bae4fb"
id="sec.3-he"><b>Definitions</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this Act&#8212;</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_9952db72-3e41-4ecc-9ccc-f1fe598107f6"
id="def.administrativeaction"><b><i>administrative action</i></b></defterm>
means an act or omission of an administrative or legislative nature, and
includes any act or omission of an administrative nature that is done or
omitted in the course of or ancillary to or preliminary to or subsequent to
judicial proceedings (civil or criminal).</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_856c86b8-c1c2-4110-a3c8-f4a83d3865a8"
id="def.commencementtime"><b><i>commencement time</i></b></defterm> means
(except as provided by section 4 (4))&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_9e11fba5-da89-4c08-a872-95aa279082b7" id="sec.3-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">in relation to the <legref refid="act-1994-053"
jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Agricultural
and Veterinary Chemicals (New South Wales) Act
1994</i></name></legref>&#8212;the time when section 4 (1) (a) commences,
or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_b5672d31-3348-4782-941c-83c2a94c512d" id="sec.3-para1.a1">
<no>(a1)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">in relation to the <legref refid="act-2005-012"
jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Water
Efficiency Labelling and Standards (New South Wales) Act
2005</i></name></legref>&#8212;the time when section 4 (1) (a1) commences,
or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_0de45107-76d8-4336-aa76-3ffe18b401d3" id="sec.3-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">in relation to any other relevant State
Act&#8212;the time when it becomes a relevant State Act for the purposes of
this Act by a proclamation made under section 4
(2).</txt></block></li></list>
</block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_96f1ee48-6cb6-4332-ae7a-85457c73d085"
id="def.Commonwealthauthority"><b><i>Commonwealth authority</i></b></defterm>
means an authority or body (whether incorporated or not) that is established
or continued in existence by or under an Act of the Commonwealth, but does not
include the Federal Court of Australia or the Federal Circuit and Family Court
of Australia.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_e588c1ee-0b02-4910-a49b-dc4bf0f82028"
id="def.confer"><b><i>confer</i></b></defterm> includes impose.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_6d2c9a38-50d6-4308-a1f3-1487890ec794"
id="def.function"><b><i>function</i></b></defterm> includes a
duty.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_ddbcbc7e-5686-4c60-bc5b-d24835f3bd79"
id="def.invalidadministrativeaction"><b><i>invalid administrative
action</i></b></defterm> means an administrative action of a Commonwealth
authority or an officer of the Commonwealth taken, or purportedly
taken&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_a21455af-39a8-42f8-9de7-c5ee44598628" id="sec.3-para1.a-oc.2">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">pursuant to a function or power conferred, or
purportedly conferred, by or under a relevant State Act (the <defterm
type="definition" guid="_fdfd4777-a729-4c7a-92cf-4a42aa77af00"
id="sec.3-para1.a-def.relevantfunctionorpower"><b><i>relevant function or
power</i></b></defterm>), and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_401b8d81-e400-4073-af6d-89ef9cc3cc35" id="sec.3-para1.b-oc.2">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">in circumstances where the relevant function or
power could not have been conferred on the authority or officer by a law of
the Commonwealth the operation of which in the relevant respect was based on
the legislative powers of the Parliament of the Commonwealth (including, for
example, circumstances where the authority or officer was, or purportedly was,
under an express or implied duty to perform the function or exercise the
power),</txt></block></li></list>

<txt break.before="1">that was invalid because of the circumstances referred
to in paragraphs (a) and (b), whether or not it was also invalid on any other
ground.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_88a1ff86-eaea-4d90-b4af-a5040faa1304"
id="def.liability"><b><i>liability</i></b></defterm> includes a duty or
obligation.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_57385ab9-d819-4863-8776-efb4441ec7f5"
id="def.officeroftheCommonwealth"><b><i>officer of the
Commonwealth</i></b></defterm> has the same meaning as in section 75 (v) of
the <legref jurisd="CTH" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="no">Constitution of the Commonwealth</name></legref>.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_e0cec073-7922-4783-b763-ec696a61c7b4"
id="def.relevantfunctionorpower"><b><i>relevant function or
power</i></b></defterm> means a function or power referred to in paragraph (a)
of the definition of <defterm type="definition"
guid="_50376e54-ed42-4498-989b-947bbf2e3b2b"
id="def.invalidadministrativeaction-oc.2"><b><i>invalid administrative
action</i></b></defterm>.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_db16b742-174c-44a1-888a-4f4f848b4819"
id="def.relevantStateAct"><b><i>relevant State Act</i></b></defterm> is
defined in section 4.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_bf2603ed-8133-4b21-baed-536db7ecb9a7"
id="def.right"><b><i>right</i></b></defterm> includes an interest or
status.</txt></block></deflist>
</block>

<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 3:</b> Am 2005 No 12,
Sch 1.1 [1] [2]; 2016 No 27, Sch 2.9; 2023 No 7, Sch 2.11.</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
