<head>
<no>4</no><heading guid="_64ab6ce8-c292-4465-8b2c-5debd24f4b16"
id="sec.4-he"><b>Co-operative schemes to which this Act applies&#8212;relevant
State Acts</b></heading></head>

<pre type="auto-inserted">

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_131dc003-becd-447a-83af-e3fda28e397f"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">For the purposes of this Act, <defterm
type="definition" guid="_ed09a357-a57d-40f2-b517-73736324b151"
id="sec.4-def.relevantStateAct"><b><i>relevant State Act</i></b></defterm>
means&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_c22698ca-4c7c-4751-8ee2-a30adbd25617" id="sec.4-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the <legref refid="act-1994-053" jurisd="NSW"
type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Agricultural and Veterinary
Chemicals (New South Wales) Act 1994</i></name></legref>,
and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_771a2bdb-b77e-4c35-8468-78f2a5c37c81" id="sec.4-ssec.1-para1.a1">
<no>(a1)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the <legref refid="act-2005-012" jurisd="NSW"
type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Water Efficiency Labelling
and Standards (New South Wales) Act 2005</i></name></legref>,
and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_6dfe521a-4103-4c41-978b-2f29824d8784" id="sec.4-ssec.1-para1.a2">
<no>(a2)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">Part 1A of the <legref refid="act-1998-121"
jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Marine Safety
Act 1998</i></name></legref>, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_88979b7d-b4ab-4b0c-9504-4a131172a599" id="sec.4-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">any other Act or part of an Act specified in a
proclamation under subsection (2),</txt></block></li></list>

<txt break.before="1">and includes any law applying as a law of the State by
force of any such Act or part of an Act.</txt></block></tier>
</pre>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_36ce13b6-98cd-46cc-8872-0dd844fbdd4b"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A proclamation may declare that a specified Act
or part of an Act is a relevant State Act for the purposes of this
Act.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_55394e06-1b99-4316-8df0-dbe907c41f29"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A proclamation under subsection (2)
commences&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_aa4815aa-f3ea-47f5-9d13-44248670d309" id="sec.4-ssec.3-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">at the beginning of the day on which it is
published in the Gazette, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_57fefd12-2c16-4086-93d7-3db352ac80c9" id="sec.4-ssec.3-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">at a later time, being a specified time of a day
specified in the proclamation.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_9474d7a5-1f1b-4670-b15d-95b1ab640243"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(4)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A proclamation may declare that the commencement
time in relation to a relevant State Act is the specified time of a day
specified in the proclamation (being a day that is not later than the day on
which the proclamation is published in the Gazette). This Act has effect in
respect of the commencement time so declared whether or not it has already had
effect in respect of an earlier commencement time.</txt></block></tier>


<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 4:</b> Am 2005 No 12,
Sch 1.1 [3]; 2012 No 90, Sch 2.1 [1]&#8211;[3].</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_002b3a57-7899-4d31-8b11-b64713b7e591"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>5</no><heading guid="_e2d9dc46-0521-4154-a7c1-d4bef4376770"
id="sec.5-he"><b>Administrative functions and powers conferred on Commonwealth
authorities and officers</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_ffc585a5-4068-466a-89dd-b0f4df79f583"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A relevant State Act does not purport to confer
any duty on a Commonwealth authority or an officer of the Commonwealth to
perform a function, or to exercise a power, in relation to a matter arising
under the relevant State Act if the conferral of the duty would be beyond the
legislative power of the Parliament of the State.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_3341987a-4c73-4049-bf17-cc912b9583ff"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This section does not limit the operation of
section 31 of the <legref refid="act-1987-015" jurisd="NSW" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Interpretation Act
1987</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></tier>
</level>
</level>


<level type="part" id="pt.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_2565e440-d7c6-4f18-872a-7d234b52f4ec"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="pt.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no><b>Part 2</b></no><heading guid="_cd8973ad-2446-474c-ab6a-b1c809a82927"
id="pt.2-he"><b>Validation of invalid administrative
actions</b></heading></head>

<level type="clause" id="sec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_e98d4b8c-2860-47de-a390-c0b2074ffc64"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>6</no><heading guid="_19d72c42-0fb2-4a0b-ac8d-2b8b0ebf413b"
id="sec.6-he"><b>Invalid administrative actions to which Part
applies</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Part applies to invalid administrative
actions that have been taken, or have purportedly been taken, under a relevant
State Act at or before the commencement time in relation to that
Act.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.7">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_db5573f5-9555-40da-a815-a265268bf9da"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>7</no><heading guid="_4e7c1f43-b89b-4aef-a4bf-789e59c0ff2f"
id="sec.7-he"><b>Operation of Part</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.7-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_30e6537f-3087-4e51-9e5b-694a0ffdee0e"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Subject to subsection (2), this Part extends to
rights or liabilities arising between parties to proceedings initiated at or
before the commencement time in relation to a relevant State Act where an
allegedly invalid administrative action is or was the subject of or relevant
to the proceedings.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.7-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_e7999218-c2c1-42fe-a8b7-6b4c1ffc76cc"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Part does not affect rights or liabilities
arising between parties to proceedings heard and finally determined at or
before the commencement time in relation to a relevant State Act to the extent
to which those rights or liabilities arise from, or are affected by, an
invalid administrative action.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.7-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_5617e57f-2b82-410c-8af8-b2bcdc038189"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Part extends to administrative actions as
affected by the operation of section 28B of the <legref refid="act-1994-053"
jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Agricultural
and Veterinary Chemicals (New South Wales) Act
1994</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.8">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_009717dc-2cf2-4342-ae37-7e730cfe57bd"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>8</no><heading guid="_4b766d92-103a-4425-85cb-dcf7682e061d"
id="sec.8-he"><b>Legal effect of invalid administrative
actions</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Every invalid administrative action has, and is
deemed always to have had, the same force and effect for all purposes as it
would have had if&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_f829cf57-7616-4ab7-b5e4-1b5f29681da9" id="sec.8-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">it had been taken, or purportedly taken, by a
State authority or officer of the State, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_738b0452-907d-4aa6-91c3-f01dc617bcb7" id="sec.8-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the relevant function or power had been duly
conferred on that authority or officer.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.9">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_09ec53b4-a8d5-4ae9-a27a-45797e6cfae6"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>9</no><heading guid="_1f4e769d-5edf-4ddd-b0ab-4e95c8b812db"
id="sec.9-he"><b>Rights and liabilities declared in certain
cases</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.9-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_c94cf28e-4bbb-4a88-9f10-4c79d80ffd49"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Without affecting the generality of section 8,
the rights and liabilities of all persons are, by force of this Act, declared
to be, and always to have been, for all purposes the same as if&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_9dbb5d46-9cf8-4dc3-accc-0370e7b206ce" id="sec.9-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">every invalid administrative action had been
taken, or purportedly taken, by a State authority or officer of the State,
and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_2587ccac-df07-464f-8204-43f74ddf3d59" id="sec.9-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the relevant function or power had been duly
conferred on that authority or officer.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.9-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_bdf6c729-41bd-49a0-888c-260ef29c277d"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A right or liability conferred or affected by
subsection (1)&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_b0ad2fa9-57c3-4ee3-ad14-0c61fa396c52" id="sec.9-ssec.2-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">is exercisable or enforceable,
and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_7fc2d8f5-f189-46cb-9d3f-ae5f6f0e8336" id="sec.9-ssec.2-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">is to be regarded as always having been
exercisable or enforceable,</txt></block></li></list>

<txt break.before="1">as if it were a right or liability conferred or affected
by (or arising from) an administrative action of a State authority or officer
of the State on which or whom the relevant function or power had been duly
conferred.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.9-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_20b939fb-27c4-4e59-bdd0-e1b259a2e156"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Any act or thing done or omitted to be done at or
before the commencement time in relation to a relevant State Act under or in
relation to a right or liability conferred or affected by subsection
(1)&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_f15c8770-590c-461d-91a1-9d731594d712" id="sec.9-ssec.3-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">has the same effect, and gives rise to the same
consequences, for the purposes of any written or other law,
and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_9654ef91-f363-424d-8d12-ed58bbb0a62f" id="sec.9-ssec.3-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">is to be regarded as always having had the same
effect, and given rise to the same consequences, for the purposes of any
written or other law,</txt></block></li></list>

<txt break.before="1">as if it were done, or omitted to be done, to give
effect to, or under the authority of, or in reliance on, an administrative
action of a State authority or officer of the State on which or whom the
relevant function or power had been duly conferred.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.10">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_e0806066-b3b8-4c4f-b69c-819eba317b94"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.10"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>10</no><heading guid="_40746757-ab54-4c5f-9809-3f57e31aab29"
id="sec.10-he"><b>This Part to apply to administrative actions as purportedly
in force from time to time</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.10-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_f326a49b-b1da-4439-b79b-bb973ad5ef72"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.10-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The purpose of this section is to ensure that
this Part operates to give to an invalid administrative action that has
subsequently been affected by another action or process no greater effect than
it would have had if the administrative action, or any other relevant
administrative action, had not been invalid on constitutional grounds (arising
from the circumstances referred to in paragraphs (a) and (b) of the definition
of <defterm type="definition" guid="_897dcb0b-6cad-43e6-ad0d-4f021ee5f121"
id="sec.10-def.invalidadministrativeaction"><b><i>invalid administrative
action</i></b></defterm> in section 3).</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.10-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_a46e6d99-5790-4130-89e7-2ab23d36e507"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.10-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">If administrative action taken by a Commonwealth
authority or an officer of the Commonwealth was affected (whether by way of
revocation, modification or otherwise) at or before the commencement time in
relation to a relevant State Act by any later administrative action or by any
judicial process or by any administrative review process, this Part applies to
the administrative action as so affected from time to
time.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.10-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_98bcdc46-2ef6-4bfe-8c65-17802d4f1118"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.10-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this section, a reference to administrative
action taken includes a reference to administrative action purportedly taken,
and a reference to administrative action affected in any way includes a
reference to administrative action purportedly affected in that
way.</txt></block></tier>
</level>
</level>


<level type="part" id="pt.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_bb3b49a1-77df-48e9-a494-50384f09f344"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="pt.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no><b>Part 3</b></no><heading guid="_fb3847b2-833b-41cd-bee9-976636fd8b8a"
id="pt.3-he"><b>Miscellaneous</b></heading></head>

<level type="clause" id="sec.11">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_1e145150-a260-46c0-b221-1057aea8cd48"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.11"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>11</no><heading guid="_09cf3680-f47f-4c0f-a747-7a5f266dc26a"
id="sec.11-he"><b>Act binds Crown</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act binds the Crown in right of New South
Wales and, in so far as the legislative power of the Parliament of New South
Wales permits, the Crown in all its other capacities.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.12">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_86c43d89-1891-48c9-be11-e6834ff3fb81"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.12"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>12</no><heading guid="_101e8704-5f7c-4527-bbcb-9b01e1d4ddd4"
id="sec.12-he"><b>Corresponding authorities or officers</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">It is immaterial, for the purposes of this Act,
that a Commonwealth authority or an officer of the Commonwealth does not have
a counterpart in the State, or that the powers and functions of a counterpart
State authority or a counterpart officer of the State do not correspond
exactly or substantially with those of the Commonwealth authority or the
officer of the Commonwealth.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.13">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_86a08efc-4c4a-4c8f-8dcf-bc93a089d6de"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.13"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>13</no><heading guid="_2636c583-2ae6-4be6-a27e-d0befef4fd7e"
id="sec.13-he"><b>Act not to give rise to liability against the
State</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.13-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_8fd3483e-f43d-497b-a07a-b05937da7b12"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.13-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The State is not liable to any action, liability,
claim or demand arising from the enactment, commencement or operation of this
Act or the making, publication or operation of a proclamation under section
4.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.13-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_aa9176b4-f6e5-4c1e-b580-fa2084ac7fa8"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.13-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Without limiting subsection (1), no proceedings
lie against the State in respect of an administrative action affected by this
Act, except to the extent that the proceedings would lie had this Act not been
enacted or a proclamation under section 4 not been made.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.13-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_c0004bf1-4949-466c-94a3-c7acfbe24ecf"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.13-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this section&#8212;</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_dbeeb295-64f2-478f-ae17-26b9d209592e"
id="sec.13-def.proceedings"><b><i>proceedings</i></b></defterm> includes
proceedings for an order in the nature of prohibition, certiorari or mandamus
or for a declaration or injunction or for any other relief.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_4cf71584-6e6f-4c61-8fe0-983d4e3bff17"
id="sec.13-def.theState"><b><i>the State</i></b></defterm> includes any State
authority or officer of the State, and also includes&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_36c91b8e-c426-4791-954b-5f35c0e8b549" id="sec.13-ssec.3-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the Crown in right of the State,
and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_4d38ae01-1679-455c-b8ff-db7fbb0aae37" id="sec.13-ssec.3-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the Government of the State,
and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_8144fab0-717d-4ac8-8b70-e2275188cb8d" id="sec.13-ssec.3-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a Minister of the Crown in right of the State,
and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_c02c2008-d785-4fa1-9d7c-5e927b7b76b7" id="sec.13-ssec.3-para1.d">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a statutory corporation, or other body,
representing the Crown in right of the State.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></deflist>
</block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.14">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_bbcbd864-6d8c-4a60-8d35-fa92e87c7975"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.14"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>14</no><heading guid="_005f787b-a49e-4746-8403-dae16c24e6ef"
id="sec.14-he"><b>Regulations</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.14-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_9426076d-046c-42bc-8455-3ccb01f13542"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.14-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Governor may make regulations, not
inconsistent with this Act, for or with respect to any matter that by this Act
is required or permitted to be prescribed or that is necessary or convenient
to be prescribed for carrying out or giving effect to this
Act.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.14-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_b080b649-0446-4836-8bf3-56f5afab1fb0"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.14-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In particular, the regulations may contain
provisions of a savings or transitional nature consequent on the enactment of
this Act or the making of a proclamation under section
4.</txt></block></tier>
</level>
</level>
</content>


